&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Design and code end-to-end processes enabling&amp;nbsp;operational&amp;nbsp;staff to autonomously prepare, install and&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;all Linux servers,&amp;nbsp;networking devices&amp;nbsp;and cameras&amp;nbsp;installed in&amp;nbsp;300+ sport venues&amp;nbsp;across the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Design and code end-to-end processes enabling developers to autonomously deploy and&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;our player tracking and augmentation applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
